AspNetRoles
~~~~~~~~~~~

Role definitions for role-based access control.

+------------------+------+--------------+-----------------------------+
| Column           | Type | Constraints  | Notes                       |
+==================+======+==============+=============================+
| Id               | TEXT | PRIMARY KEY  | Unique role identifier      |
+------------------+------+--------------+-----------------------------+
