| Column             | Type      | Constraints              | Notes       |
+====================+===========+==========================+=============+
| Id                 | INTEGER   | PRIMARY KEY              | Permission  |
|                    |           | AUTO_INCREMENT           | record      |
|                    |           |                          | identifier  |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| RoleName           | TEXT      | NOT NULL                 | Role name   |
|                    |           |                          | (Admin,     |
|                    |           |                          | Director,   |
|                    |           |                          | Tutor)      |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanDeleteStudents  | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can delete  |
|                    |           |                          | students    |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanDeleteAdmins    | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can delete  |
|                    |           |                          | admin users |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanDeleteDirectors | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can delete  |
|                    |           |                          | director    |
|                    |           |                          | users (0/1) |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanDeleteTutors    | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can delete  |
|                    |           |                          | tutor users |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanEditAdmins      | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can edit    |
|                    |           |                          | admin users |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanEditDirectors   | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can edit    |
|                    |           |                          | director    |
|                    |           |                          | users (0/1) |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanEditTutors      | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can edit    |
|                    |           |                          | tutor users |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
+--------------------+-----------+--------------------------+-------------+
| CanManageAdmins    | INTEGER   | NOT NULL DEFAULT 0       | Can manage  |
|                    |           |                          | admins      |
|                    |           |                          | (0/1)       |
